ORDINAL REGRESSION ANALYSIS FOR AMPHIBIAN CALL INTENSITIES
================================================================================

Modeling framework:
  • Cumulative-link (ordinal) regression
  • Splines for nonlinear environmental effects
  • Fourier terms for cyclic temporal patterns
  • Lags for serial dependence and cross-species influence
